{"code":"393970","name":"대진첨단소재","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"전기제품","sector_desc":"2차전지 셀·전선·전기 부품 등. 전기차와 에너지저장장치(ESS) 수요가 주요 동력입니다.","desc":"동사는 2019년 이차전지 공정용 소재, 자동차부품용 소재 등을 제조 및 도소매업 목적으로 설립되었으며, 2025년 코스닥시장에 상장함. 배터리 제조공정 중 대전방지 트레이, PET 이형필름, CNT 개질분산 기술을 활용한 대전방지 코팅액 등을 주력 제품으로 사업을 영위하고 있음. 자동차 내장재용 플라스틱 부품 등을 국내외 고객에 납품하고 있으며, 고부가가치 신소재 시장 선점을 위해 CNT 사업을 신성장동력으로 추진하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-16","n_days":300,"close":2825.0,"open":2825.0,"high":2825.0,"low":2825.0,"volume":0,"amount":0.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":0.0,"ret_5":0.0,"ret_20":0.0,"ret_60":0.0,"ret_120":0.0,"ret_250":-56.0653,"ma20":2825.0,"ma60":2825.0,"ma120":2825.0,"ma200":3128.05,"close_vs_ma200":-9.6881,"close_vs_ma60":0.0,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":0.0,"r2_60":0.0,"slope_120":0.0,"r2_120":0.0,"slope_250":-55.8375,"r2_250":0.6733,"high52":8370.0,"low52":0.0,"pos_52w":33.7515,"dd_52w":-66.2485,"mdd_1y":-69.6163,"atr14_pct":92.8571,"vol_ann_60":0.0,"vol_avg20":0.0,"vol_ratio20":null,"vr5":null,"vr20":null,"amount_avg5":0.0,"amount_avg20":0.0,"amount_avg60":0.0,"obv_chg20":null,"turnover_20":0.0,"pv_eff_20":null,"rsi14":32.6262,"frgn_net_5":0.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_20":0.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_60":0.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_120":0.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.0,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":0.0,"foreign_ratio":3.89,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.02,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":-6.0,"op_margin_q":-2.2222,"op_qoq":87.7551,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":87.7551,"rev_yoy":119.5122,"op_trend_4q":12.16,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-48.11,"debt_ratio":151.56,"per":null,"pbr":0.81,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":3.89,"target_price":null,"recomm":null,"nxt_close":null,"nxt_change_pct":null,"cns_per":null,"code":"393970","name":"대진첨단소재",